WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.909
"Spontaneous Regression
of Cancer with Fasting"

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.120
In 2015, a remarkable case report
was published in which a woman

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.600
with Stage 3 follicular lymphoma
underwent a medically supervised,

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.200
21-day water-only fast, after which
her enlarged lymph nodes

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.120
were substantially reduced in size.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.840
The patient then remained
on a whole food, plant-based diet,

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:32.880
and at 6- and 9-month follow-up
visits she remained asymptomatic.

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.900
In 2018, her 3-year
follow-up was published.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:40.140
Remarkably, she appeared
to remain cancer-free,

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.120
confirmed by CT and PET scans.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:45.660
Her cancer appeared to have been
knocked down and out.

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:49.200
The initial regression has
persisted for the three years

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.860
with no additional intervention
other than the dietary change.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.920
Could it have just
been a coincidence?

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.880
Sure, but the initial regression
directly coincided

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:04.080
with the timing of her water-only fast,
suggesting a causal relationship,

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:09.360
and there are biological mechanisms
by which fasting may potentiate

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:12.780
tumor regression, such as
decreasing levels of IGF-1.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:17.880
The term "spontaneous regression"
of cancer is a misnomer.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:20.700
I mean, obviously there was
something that caused the regression,

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.500
whether or not we know what it is.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.500
Presumably the immune
system plays a role.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.800
The fact that you can get
a marked increase in cancer rates

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:32.160
when you're immunosuppressed
suggests that cancers are popping up

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:36.600
all the time, but your immune system
is normally able to keep them at bay.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:41.460
There was an example, for instance,
of a regression after a transfusion

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:44.220
of blood from a patient
who had previously sustained

00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:47.820
a spontaneous regression.
Or cases of patients

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:52.560
who had been free of metastases
for 15 or 20 years, only to develop

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:56.760
rapidly fatal metastases after
some type of stress or shock

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.180
that apparently sharply
reduced their resistance.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:04.500
For most cancers, spontaneous
regression is exceedingly rare,

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.720
but lymphoma is an exception.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:09.240
Of 140 cases of nodular lymphoma --

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:11.730
which is what they used
to call follicular lymphoma --

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:16.620
there were 18 cases of at least partial
and 6 cases of complete regression.

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:20.580
So like 1 in 25 cases
just go away on their own.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:23.340
So when you have
follicular lymphoma cases

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:25.500
in which tumors shrink
after any kind of treatment --

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.840
in this case after some
herbal supplement --

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:30.780
you always have to ask:
is this cause-and-effect

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:32.700
or just coincidence?

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:37.680
Elevated natural killing activity may
be one of the possible mechanisms

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:41.460
responsible for spontaneous
regression of malignant lymphoma.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:44.340
Natural killer cells may be part
of our first line of defense

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.040
against cancer by
destroying tumor cells.

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:49.560
And if you compare
the natural killer cell activity

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:53.340
of those with malignant lymphoma
that spontaneously regressed

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:56.040
versus those whose cancer didn't,
or a control group,

00:02:56.040 --> 00:03:00.300
the spontaneous regression group
do seem to be on the high end.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.330
How do we increase 
natural killer cell activity?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.680
Exercise can do it,

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:07.500
unless, apparently,
you're eating a high-fat diet.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.200
Those randomized to undergo
an exercise training program

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:13.020
on a high-fat diet actually
suffered a decline

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.880
in natural killer cell activity,

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:19.980
suggesting training on a high-fat diet
is detrimental to the immune system.

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:22.440
Eating lots of contaminated fatty fish

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:25.440
may also adversely
affect NK cell levels.

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:28.980
But put people on a low-fat diet,
and you can dramatically increase

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:33.180
natural killer cell activity within
a matter of months by about 50%,

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:36.720
suggesting that dietary fat might
increase the formation of cancer

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.920
by depressing the tumor surveillance
capacity of the immune system.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:46.380
The bottom line in terms of fasting
is that, at present, long-term fasting

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:49.800
in cancer treatment is supported
only by some case reports,

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:52.740
so more research is
desperately needed.

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:55.980
Sadly, there is no 
current clinical research

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.440
evaluating the effects of water-only
fasting and a whole food,

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:01.440
plant-based diet on follicular
lymphoma in humans.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:04.740
Long-term fasting is
certainly not without risk.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:08.220
In this case, a guy opted
to try a 60-day fast

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.980
instead of chemotherapy
for non-Hodgkin lymphoma,

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:15.540
ending up hospitalized
in a coma and respiratory failure

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:18.000
because of Wernicke encephalopathy,

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.040
a life-threatening
neurological emergency

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:22.500
caused by thiamine deficiency.

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:28.620
But starting on a healthier diet
seems like a win-win no-brainer.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.320
Just putting people on a plant-based,
whole food, you know,

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:34.680
sugar-oil-salt-free diet,
with or without fasting,

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:41.634
is sometimes sufficient to induce
an intense healing response.

